<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="vi" class="dark">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title><%= typeof settings !== "undefined" && settings.site_title ? settings.site_title : "PhimTop1 API Hub" %></title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <script src="https://unpkg.com/lucide@latest"></script>
    <style>
        body { background-color: #0d1117; color: #c9d1d9; font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif; }
        .bg-card { background-color: #161b22; }
        .border-card { border-color: #30363d; }
    </style>
    <meta name="msvalidate.01" content="3272BDE866C77FFFE8499EB05F224A6B" />
    <meta name="description" content="<%= typeof settings !== "undefined" && settings.site_description ? settings.site_description : "" %>">
</head>
<body class="antialiased min-h-screen flex flex-col">
    <!-- Navbar -->
    <header class="border-b border-card bg-[#0d1117] sticky top-0 z-50">
        <div class="max-w-[1440px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 h-16 flex items-center justify-between">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <i data-lucide="terminal-square" class="w-6 h-6 text-cyan-400"></i>
                <a href="/" class="font-bold text-xl text-white tracking-tight">PhimTop1<span class="text-cyan-400">API</span></a>
            </div>
            <nav class="hidden md:flex gap-6 text-sm font-medium">
                <a href="/" class="hover:text-white transition">Tài liệu API</a>
                <a href="/cms" class="text-white flex items-center gap-1 border-b-2 border-cyan-400 pb-1"><i data-lucide="download" class="w-4 h-4"></i> Mã Nguồn CMS</a>
                <a href="<%= typeof settings !== "undefined" && settings.telegram_link ? settings.telegram_link : "https://t.me/" %>" target="_blank" class="hover:text-white transition">Hỗ trợ</a>
            </nav>
        </div>
    </header>

    <main class="flex-grow max-w-[1440px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16 w-full">
        <!-- Hero -->
        <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16">
            <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-cyan-500/10 text-cyan-400 text-xs font-bold border border-cyan-500/20 mb-6">
                MÃ NGUỒN MỞ TỰ ĐỘNG 100%
            </div>
            <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold text-white mb-6 tracking-tight leading-tight">
                Xây dựng Website Phim <br/><span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-400 to-blue-500">Chỉ Trong Vài Phút</span>
            </h1>
            <p class="text-lg text-gray-400 mb-8">
                Bộ công cụ Source Code, Theme và Plugin cào dữ liệu tự động miễn phí giúp bạn triển khai website phim từ API của PhimTop1 một cách nhanh chóng và tối ưu SEO.
            </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Downloads Grid -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 mb-16">
            <!-- Source Code -->
            <div class="bg-card border border-card rounded-xl p-8 flex flex-col hover:border-cyan-500/30 transition relative overflow-hidden group">
                <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 p-4 opacity-10 group-hover:opacity-20 transition">
                    <i data-lucide="code-2" class="w-24 h-24 text-cyan-400"></i>
                </div>
                <div class="p-3 bg-cyan-500/10 rounded-lg text-cyan-400 border border-cyan-500/20 w-fit mb-6">
                    <i data-lucide="code-2" class="w-6 h-6"></i>
                </div>
                <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-3">PhimTop1 CMS</h3>
                <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm mb-6 flex-grow">
                    Mã nguồn phim viết bằng Node.js / Express tối ưu tốc độ bàn thờ. Cài đặt đơn giản, giao diện hiện đại, tự động đồng bộ dữ liệu phim mới nhất.
                </p>
                <div class="flex flex-col gap-3">
                    <a href="#" class="w-full py-2.5 px-4 bg-cyan-600 hover:bg-cyan-500 text-white font-medium rounded-lg text-sm transition text-center flex justify-center items-center gap-2">
                        <i data-lucide="github" class="w-4 h-4"></i> Tải Source Code (Github)
                    </a>
                    <a href="#" class="text-cyan-400 hover:text-cyan-300 text-sm text-center">Xem hướng dẫn cài đặt &rarr;</a>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- WordPress Plugin -->
            <div class="bg-card border border-card rounded-xl p-8 flex flex-col hover:border-blue-500/30 transition relative overflow-hidden group">
                <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 p-4 opacity-10 group-hover:opacity-20 transition">
                    <i data-lucide="webhook" class="w-24 h-24 text-blue-400"></i>
                </div>
                <div class="p-3 bg-blue-500/10 rounded-lg text-blue-400 border border-blue-500/20 w-fit mb-6">
                    <i data-lucide="webhook" class="w-6 h-6"></i>
                </div>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-4 text-purple-400">2. Tải Plugin Crawler PhimTop1 Độc Lập</h3>
                <p class="text-gray-300 text-sm mb-6">Plugin dành cho WordPress (Bản độc lập, không phụ thuộc Ophim). Giao diện quản trị chuyên nghiệp, tự động cào phim theo lịch hẹn cron từ hệ thống API PhimTop1, tương thích hoàn toàn với Theme PhimTop1.</p>
                <div class="flex gap-4">
                    <a href="/downloads/phimtop1-crawler-standalone.zip" class="flex-1 text-center bg-purple-600 hover:bg-purple-700 text-white font-bold py-3 px-6 rounded-lg transition shadow-lg shadow-purple-600/30">
                        <i class="fas fa-spider mr-2"></i> Tải Crawler Plugin
                    </a>
                </div>

            </div>

            </div>

        <!-- Theme Library Section -->
        <div class="mt-20">
            <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row items-start md:items-center justify-between mb-8 gap-4">
                <div>
                    <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-white mb-2">Thư viện Giao diện (Themes)</h2>
                    <p class="text-gray-400">Khám phá và cài đặt hàng tá giao diện tối ưu riêng cho PhimTop1. Hỗ trợ 1-click install.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="flex items-center gap-3 w-full md:w-auto">
                    <div class="relative w-full md:w-64">
                        <i data-lucide="search" class="w-4 h-4 absolute left-3 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 text-gray-400"></i>
                        <input type="text" placeholder="Tìm kiếm theme..." class="w-full bg-card border border-card text-white text-sm rounded-lg focus:ring-cyan-500 focus:border-cyan-500 pl-10 p-2.5 outline-none">
                    </div>
                    <select class="bg-card border border-card text-white text-sm rounded-lg focus:ring-cyan-500 focus:border-cyan-500 p-2.5 outline-none whitespace-nowrap">
                        <option>Mới nhất</option>
                        <option>Phổ biến nhất</option>
                        <option>Nhiều lượt tải</option>
                        <option>Đánh giá cao</option>
                    </select>
                </div>
            </div>

            
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
                <% themes.forEach(theme => { %>
                <!-- Theme Card -->
                <div class="bg-card border border-card rounded-xl overflow-hidden group hover:border-cyan-500/50 transition duration-300">
                    <div class="relative aspect-video bg-[#1f2937] overflow-hidden">
                        <img src="<%= theme.image_url %>" alt="<%= theme.name %>" class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition duration-500" onerror="this.src='https://via.placeholder.com/600x400/1f2937/a1a1aa?text=Image+Not+Found'">
                        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-black/70 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity flex items-center justify-center gap-4 backdrop-blur-sm">
                            <button class="bg-cyan-600 hover:bg-cyan-500 text-white font-medium py-2 px-4 rounded-lg text-sm transition flex items-center gap-2"><i data-lucide="eye" class="w-4 h-4"></i> Xem Trước</button>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="p-5 flex flex-col h-[180px]">
                        <div class="flex justify-between items-start mb-2">
                            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white"><%= theme.name %></h3>
                            <span class="bg-green-500/10 text-green-400 text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full font-medium border border-green-500/20">Miễn phí</span>
                        </div>
                        <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm mb-4 line-clamp-2 flex-grow"><%= theme.description %></p>
                        <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-t border-card pt-4 mt-auto">
                            <div class="flex items-center gap-1 text-yellow-500 text-sm">
                                <i data-lucide="star" class="w-4 h-4 fill-current"></i>
                                <span class="font-medium text-white"><%= theme.rating %></span>
                                <span class="text-gray-500 text-xs ml-1">(<%= theme.downloads %>)</span>
                            </div>
                            <a href="<%= theme.download_url %>" class="bg-cyan-500/10 text-cyan-400 hover:bg-cyan-500 hover:text-white border border-cyan-500/20 font-medium px-4 py-1.5 rounded text-sm flex items-center gap-2 transition">
                                <i data-lucide="download" class="w-4 h-4"></i> Cài đặt
                            </a>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <% }) %>
            </div>

            <div class="mt-10 text-center">
                <button class="px-6 py-2.5 bg-card border border-card hover:border-cyan-500/50 hover:text-cyan-400 text-white rounded-lg transition font-medium">Tải thêm Themes...</button>
            </div>
        </div>
        
        <!-- Features Section -->
        <div class="mt-20 border-t border-card pt-16">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-10 text-center">Lý do chọn PhimTop1 CMS?</h2>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
                <div>
                    <div class="mb-4 text-cyan-400"><i data-lucide="zap" class="w-8 h-8"></i></div>
                    <h4 class="text-white font-bold mb-2">Tốc độ cao</h4>
                    <p class="text-sm text-gray-400">Tối ưu cache dữ liệu từ API, giảm tải đáng kể cho server của bạn.</p>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <div class="mb-4 text-cyan-400"><i data-lucide="search" class="w-8 h-8"></i></div>
                    <h4 class="text-white font-bold mb-2">Chuẩn SEO</h4>
                    <p class="text-sm text-gray-400">Sitemap tự động, Schema Markup chuẩn xác cho phim và tập phim.</p>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <div class="mb-4 text-cyan-400"><i data-lucide="cpu" class="w-8 h-8"></i></div>
                    <h4 class="text-white font-bold mb-2">Tự động hoá</h4>
                    <p class="text-sm text-gray-400">Hệ thống ngầm tự quét phim mới mỗi 10 phút, không cần quản trị thủ công.</p>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <div class="mb-4 text-cyan-400"><i data-lucide="monitor-smartphone" class="w-8 h-8"></i></div>
                    <h4 class="text-white font-bold mb-2">Đa thiết bị</h4>
                    <p class="text-sm text-gray-400">Giao diện responsive tương thích hoàn hảo trên điện thoại, tablet, smart TV.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </main>

    <!-- Footer -->
    <footer class="border-t border-card bg-[#0d1117] py-8 mt-auto">
        <div class="max-w-[1440px] mx-auto px-4 text-center">
            <div class="flex justify-center items-center gap-2 text-gray-500 text-sm mb-2">
                <i data-lucide="code" class="w-4 h-4"></i> Thiết kế & Vận hành bởi <strong>PhimTop1 API Hub</strong>
            </div>
            <div class="text-xs text-gray-600">Built with Node.js & Express &copy; 2026</div>
        </div>
    </footer>

    <script>
        lucide.createIcons();
    </script>
</body>
</html>
